---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service - MyLifeCarePlanning.com"
  description="Terms of Service for MyLifeCarePlanning.com. Read the terms governing your use of the directory."
>
  <Header />

  <main class="flex-1">
    <section class="bg-brand-900 text-white">
      <div class="page-container py-10">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Terms of Service</h1>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mt-3">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white/10 text-brand-200 text-xs font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Effective Date: August 1, 2026</span>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white/10 text-brand-200 text-xs font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Version 1.1</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="page-container section-padding">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="space-y-10 text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">1</span>
              Acceptance and Trademark Attribution
            </h2>
            <p class="pl-8">By using MyLifeCarePlanning.com, you agree to these terms. We acknowledge that <strong>CLCP®</strong> and <strong>MSCC</strong> are registered trademarks of the <a href="https://www.ichcc.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-700 hover:text-brand-900 underline">ICHCC</a>. Our use of these marks is purely for descriptive purposes to identify the credentials held by independent professionals.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">2</span>
              Nature of Listings and Source Disclosure
            </h2>
            <p class="pl-8">The directory is a compilation of information derived from public records. It is an educational resource and does not provide medical or legal advice. MyLifeCarePlanning.com does not verify the current status of credentials or the accuracy of third-party reports issued by listed planners.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">3</span>
              Harvesting Prohibition and DMCA
            </h2>
            <p class="pl-8">Users are strictly prohibited from using automated tools to harvest, scrape, or mine data from this directory for any purpose. Pursuant to the DMCA, if you believe any content infringes your copyright, please send a notice to our designated agent at <a href="mailto:info@mylifecareplanning.com" class="text-brand-700 font-medium hover:underline">info@mylifecareplanning.com</a>.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">4</span>
              Warranty Disclaimer and Limitation of Liability
            </h2>
            <div class="pl-8 space-y-2">
              <p class="uppercase font-semibold text-gray-800">The directory is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind, express or implied.</p>
              <p>We do not warrant that the information is accurate or current. In no event shall MyLifeCarePlanning.com be liable for any damages arising from your engagement with a listed professional.</p>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">5</span>
              Governing Law, Venue, and Arbitration
            </h2>
            <p class="pl-8">These terms are governed by the laws of the <strong>State of Florida</strong>. Any dispute arising from this agreement shall be resolved through binding arbitration in <strong>Duval County, Florida</strong>. You waive the right to participate in a class action.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">6</span>
              Modifications and Termination
            </h2>
            <p class="pl-8">We reserve the right to modify these terms or terminate access at our discretion. This agreement constitutes the entire understanding between you and MyLifeCarePlanning.com regarding the use of the directory.</p>
          </section>

          <div class="border-t border-gray-200 pt-6">
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">For questions about these terms, contact <a href="mailto:info@mylifecareplanning.com" class="text-brand-700 hover:underline">info@mylifecareplanning.com</a>.</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
